sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant C as Client
 participant E as ESTS
 Note over C,E: ConvergedChangePassword advertises begin, poll, and confirmation URLs
 C->>E: POST {urlAsyncSsprBegin} (JSON)
 Note over C,E: Ctx=sCtx, FlowToken=sFT, OldPassword, NewPassword
 E-->>C: IsJobPending, Ctx, FlowToken, routing fields, ErrorMessage
 loop job pending within local deadline
  C->>E: POST {urlAsyncSsprPoll} (JSON)
  Note over C,E: preceding Ctx, FlowToken, CoupledDataCenter, CoupledScaleUnit
  E-->>C: Updated job state and ErrorMessage
 end
 Note over C,E: Confirm only when completed without ErrorMessage
 alt JSON confirmation
  C->>E: POST {urlPost} (JSON)
  Note over C,E: Ctx, FlowToken, currentpasswd, confirmnewpasswd, canary
 else form confirmation
  C->>E: POST {urlPost} (form)
  Note over C,E: ctx, flowToken, currentpasswd, confirmnewpasswd, canary
 end
 E-->>C: Confirmation status, authorization response, or page
 Note over C,E: Dispatch returned page, restart with new password only if continuation<br/>unavailable<br/>Restart is client recovery, not a required server transition
